<title>PORTUGAL: Yield 5.8953 pct on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Yield 5.8953 pct on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management auction of 25 billion escudos of three-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: March 23, 2000</p>
<p>    AMOUNT PLACED: 19.75 bln esc   COUPON: 5.375 percent</p>
<p>PAY DATE: March 18, 1997</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.8953</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 5.92 LOWEST: 5.80</p>
<p>BIDS: 70.7 bln esc PAYMENT FREQUENCY: Annual</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 131.70 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
</text>
